==Trivia==
This card's number in the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion is 025, which is also {{p|Pikachu}}'s [[National Pokédex]] [[List of Pokémon by National Pokédex number|number]].

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Neo Genesis|Pikachu|70}} from the {{TCG|Neo Genesis}} expansion.
*'''Circle Circuit''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|XY|Raichu|43}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

